OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClouding
OL,6,Fover through the evening with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain and freshening south
OL,8,Fto southeast winds. Drier overnight as
OL,9,Fwinds ease but remaining dull and
OL,10,Fovercast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,13,Fthe day with the odd spot of light
OL,14,Fdrizzle at times. Freshening winds
OL,15,Fdeveloping later as well as some
OL,16,Fheavier outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
