OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight rain soon clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fthen sunshine and showers, windy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Windy on Wednesday with bright
OL,9,Fspells, variable cloud. Occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy rain arriving overnight,
OL,11,Fclearing southeast later Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
